{"name":"Unakite","hex":"#75a14f","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"unakite","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An altered granite composed of pink orthoclase feldspar, green epidote, and generally colorless quartz."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/unakite"}],"entries":[{"title":"Unakite","blocks":[{"text":"Unakite is a coarse-grained metamorphic rock that is an altered granitoid composed of orthoclase feldspar (pink), epidote (yellow-green), and quartz. Albite-oligoclase plagioclase (white) may or may not be also present."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Colored_minerals_closeup.jpg/330px-Colored_minerals_closeup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unakite","wikidata":"Q656325"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Unakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg/500px-Unakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Unakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg/1280px-Unakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Unakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg/500px-Unakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bear carved from unakite. Length 8 cm.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUnakite_bear_Length_8_cm_Taken_18.8.21.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Unakite_%28epidotic_granite%29_%28Buena_Vista%2C_Virginia%2C_USA%29_2.jpg/500px-Unakite_%28epidotic_granite%29_%28Buena_Vista%2C_Virginia%2C_USA%29_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimed